Overview

A cloud computing platform offered by Microsoft which provides on demand delivery of IT resources such as networks, servers, computing, and storage solutions.

How it is Used

The County uses Azure for a wide variety of operations, such as hosting public-facing County websites, storing databases of various County departments, setting security controls for data access, and more.";}s:8:"relation";a:2:{s:10:"references";a:2:{s:27:"sidebar:categories:software";b:1;s:43:"sidebar:categories:software:cloud_migration";b:1;}s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}}s:10:"persistent";a:5:{s:4:"date";a:2:{s:7:"created";i:1742945684;s:8:"modified";i:1744167989;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Aditya Seth";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1744167989;s:2:"ip";s:14:"73.235.164.232";s:4:"type";s:1:"E";s:2:"id";s:43:"sidebar:categories:software:microsoft_azure";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:0:"";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:-247;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}s:11:"contributor";a:1:{s:5:"admin";s:11:"Aditya Seth";}}}